    "Hemofoam Ampoule": {
      "name": "Hemofoam Ampoule",
      "category": "Consumable",
      "description": "A single-use applicator that expands into a sterile pressure foam, sealing many penetrating wounds and buying time against blood or sap loss. It is excellent first aid and poor definitive surgery; deep foreign objects, internal bleeding and damaged organs remain real problems.",
