      "description": "A compact emergency set containing oxygenation support, pressure-safe airway gear, warming wraps and embolism-management drugs for short vacuum or decompression exposure. It treats the aftermath after the casualty is physically recovered to pressure; it does not let someone breathe in vacuum.",
      "bonuses": []
    },
    "Concord Multispecies Antitoxin": {
      "name": "Concord Multispecies Antitoxin",
      "category": "Consumable",
      "description": "A modular injector whose cartridge carries several broad counteragents and a rapid species profile. It can blunt common poisons, contaminated bites and some biological agents when administered promptly, but an unknown engineered toxin may still need a laboratory-specific antidote.",
