      "description": "A hospital-grade regeneration cartridge for compatible Concord medbeds, containing growth scaffold, sterile nutrient medium and species-specific repair instructions. It can accelerate serious tissue recovery under clinical supervision; it is scarce, cannot be meaningfully used by waving it at a casualty in the field, and does not resurrect the dead.",
      "bonuses": []
    },
    "credit": {
