  "factions": {
    "Vanguard Joint Expeditionary Academy": {
      "name": "Vanguard Joint Expeditionary Academy",
      "basicInfo": "The Concord-Terran officer academy aboard Vanguard Station. It trains adult cadets to operate as both aerospace officers and expeditionary ground leaders. Cadets are organized into persistent Flights: nominally six members, but all player characters in a multiplayer room are assigned to the same Flight and count toward that complement before NPC vacancies are filled.",
