      "name": "Free Kharad Assembly",
      "factionType": "minor",
      "known": true,
      "basicInfo": "A loose civilian and political network of Kharad exiles, breakaway-colony delegates, reformists and defectors living outside Varkesh Hegemony control. It helps refugees navigate Concord asylum, sponsors a very small number of Vanguard cadets, and argues fiercely over whether reforming the Hegemony is still possible.",
