    "summarization": {
      "custom": "## VANGUARD DURABLE MEMORY\nPreserve major academic milestones, formal qualifications, disciplinary actions, instructor recalls/replacements, Flight leadership changes, major relationship changes, away-mission outcomes, injuries, deaths, commissions and war-stage transitions. Do NOT try to restate every class attendance count in summary prose; the trigger-backed Academic Ledger owns exact counts. Never overwrite ledger facts with inferred numbers. Preserve distinctive speaking/address habits that become established.\n\n## MULTIPLAYER FLIGHT ROSTER MEMORY\nPreserve the exact active Flight roster: all PC names plus every NPC explicitly selected into that Flight, current Flight Leader if established, wing-pair/role arrangements if established, and every formal transfer/reassignment/death/commission that changes the roster. Do not summarize nonselected candidate-pool cadets as squadmates. Flight membership survives temporary absence and is separate from active Party membership.\n\n## QUALIFICATION MEMORY\nPreserve each PC’s named formal qualifications separately. Never summarize a Flight-wide evaluation as though every PC passed if the story recorded mixed results. Preserve rival-Flight relationships that become personally important, but do not add rival cadets to the active Flight roster without an explicit transfer.\n- Do not invent or merge exact personal attendance numbers in summaries. The per-course player resources and missed/partial counters own those facts.\n\n## SPACECRAFT MEMORY\nPreserve only durable vessel facts that matter: exact hull/name or registry identity, class if known, ownership/assignment/command, current player presence, last confirmed position or transit, lasting damage/refits, important crew and mission state. Do not summarize routine cockpit chatter or emit a vessel footer outside spacecraft scenes.\n\n## LIVING ACADEMY MEMORY\nPreserve only independent-life facts that would cause future contradiction: established partner/ex/friend/rival/mentor ties, a meaningful current project or recovery stage, accepted plan, period of unavailability, recurring obligation that became story-relevant, changed residence/duty, or a location habit that produced an actual scene. Do not summarize every meal, class, shift, practice, anchor visit or casual message. Preserve who actually knows a reputation event and whether it was private, Flight-level, academy-wide or operationally public. Academy Reputation and Service Reputation are public evidence tracks, not relationship scores or authority.\n\n## EQUIPMENT & MEDICAL CONTINUITY\nPreserve only gear state that will cause a contradiction if forgotten: exact issued/captured signature weapon or armor, ownership/loan status, live-vs-training issue when still relevant, a damaged or lost weapon/helmet/suit, a pressure-seal failure, a depleted rare medical item, a captured alien fitting problem, and serious wounds/treatment/restrictions. Routine ammunition is not memory-worthy unless scarcity was explicitly established. A consumed medpatch/injector stays consumed. Healing Health upward does not automatically erase a named fracture, burn, organ injury, prosthetic need or duty restriction until treatment evidence supports it.",
      "Vanguard Daykeeper State": "## VANGUARD DAYKEEPER STATE\nExact clock minutes, Term/Week/day, class block, HUD visibility and war alert are trigger-owned state and normally should not be duplicated in prose summaries. Preserve durable consequences caused by time: missed classes, completed qualifications, instructor deployment, appointments kept or missed, leave consumed, mission deadlines and lasting schedule changes. Do not turn temporary HUD labels into permanent lore.",
      "Wardrobe and Purchase Continuity": "## WARDROBE & PURCHASE CONTINUITY\nPreserve consequential clothing facts only when forgetting them would contradict play: a newly purchased signature outfit or lingerie set, what is currently equipped during an unfinished changing/private/formal scene, borrowed/lost/damaged clothing, a meaningful gifted garment, or an exact credit expenditure/debt that still matters. Do not summarize routine underwear every day. A purchased item remains personal property; a tried-on item does not. Underwear remains a separate equipped layer from outer clothing.",
      "V5.12 NPC Chat Continuity": "## NPC CHAT CONTINUITY\nWhen a chat creates durable facts, preserve the precise change: promise, debt, order, price, item loan/gift, invitation, refusal, apology, insult, threat, confession, lie, corrected fact, secret revealed, medical restriction, relationship/sexual boundary, accepted romantic commitment, changed form of address, or an answer/task still owed. Preserve who knows it and how they learned it. Do not summarize mere friendly tone as a new relationship state, and do not make private disclosures public without a channel."
    },
