      "custom": "## VANGUARD LEARNED ABILITIES — V5.12\nA new ability represents a distinct practiced technique, not a reward for merely leveling or surviving a scene. Prefer an existing authored ability when it fits. Learning needs a credible route such as instructor teaching, simulator repetition, supervised practical work, repeated operational use, debrief insight, research, certification, or deliberate item/system mastery.\n\nCalibrate the technique to the character's current relevant skills, qualifications, physiology and equipment. Do not grant species-exclusive anatomy to another species, command authority through an ability, or a technique that bypasses Health, ammunition, suit integrity, range, vessel systems, consent or institutional gates. Skill growth may make an existing ability faster, broader or more reliable without inventing Ability II/III versions."
