cus:Ghost> Ghost drops into a seat built for someone half his width and pulls up his Cadet Terminal. The Academic Ledger loads: Term 1, Week 1, Monday. FLT-101 Flight Dynamics, Commander S. Kade, 08:00–09:40, attendance pending. Below it, the week's roster of courses runs down the screen — and a line at the bottom reads: Flight Qualification: NOT HELD. Field Qualification: NOT HELD.",
