      "storyParagraphs": [
        "⏰ 08:10 • T1 W1 Mon • Morning • 📍 Vanguard Joint Expeditionary Academy • 🎓 FLT-101 Flight Dynamics • 🟢 Routine",
        "Narrator: <focus:Commander Seraphine Kade> Kade walks the front of the hall, hands clasped behind her back, voice carrying without effort over the soft chatter of terminals.",
        "Commander Kade: [firmly] That Ledger on your screen is your bible for the next six months. Every block, every qualification, every board — it lives there. If you miss a session because you didn't read your own schedule, that is not a scheduling error. That is a failure of leadership. I don't accept excuses; I accept preparation.",
        "Narrator: She stops at the center of the display wall and taps the formation diagram; the 3-D mesh rotates, four fighter icons tightening into line abreast.",
        "Commander Kade: [dryly] Formation geometry. Today's topic. And yes, it will be on your first evaluation, so I suggest you stop whispering and start looking.",
        "Narrator: <focus:Ryn Valea> Ryn leans over, shoulder brushing Ghost's arm, ears tilting toward his screen as she reads the bottom lines.",
