        "Ghost": "I place one hand on ryn's head and curl and uncurl all five fingers in a, kinda, scalp massage-petting way as i raise my free hand \"Question. You said us missing a session is not a scheduling issue but leadership issue. So, if one of us misses a session it is your fault then, considering that you hold leadership position?\""
