        "Ghost": "> OOC: Ghost spends one year ace-ing every class and giving all he has so, for the remainder of his time at the academy he can chill. At the same time he takes his time to build a relationship with Ryn, Sera and Vesha. After some months they end up in ENM Poly V with Ghost as hinge and the three girls as a form of sisterhood in their relationship with him."
